{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>The Kenite.</b> Ten nations are here, but He gave them only seven nations. The remaining three — Edom, Moab, and Ammon — and they are the Kenite, the Kenizzite, and the Kadmonite, are destined to be an inheritance for the future (Bereshit Rabbah), as it says: ״אֱדוֹם וּמוֹאָב מִשְׁלוֹחַ יָדָם וּבְנֵי עַמּוֹן מִשְׁמַעְתָּם״ (Isaiah 11)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:52.259802210Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}